    'every row gains ge2 (GE(2) on the same per-day vector), ge2Gap (genEntropy - ge2), and genEntropyOverGe2 (genEntropy / ge2). Surfaces moment-family tail-bias asymmetry at alpha=-1 vs alpha=+2.',
